\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. We give immortal praise
\par To God the Father's love,
\par For all our comforts here,
\par And better hopes above 
\par He sent His own eternal Son,
\par To die for sins that man had done.
\par  
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. To God the Son belongs
\par Immortal glory too,
\par Who bought us with His blood
\par From everlasting woe;
\par And now He lives, and now He reigns,
\par And sees the fruit of all His pains.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. To God the Spirit's name
\par Immortal worship give 
\par Whose new-creating power
\par Makes the dead sinner live
\par His work completes the great design,
\par And fills the soul with joy divine.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Almighty God, to Thee
\par Be endless honors done,
\par The undivided Three,
\par And the mysterious One
\par Where reason fails, with all her powers,
\par There faith prevails and love adores.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

